# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Repo Hygiene Gate — operator-side diagnostic patterns
#
# Added 2026-05-06 per the Repo Hygiene Gate directive. These match
# files written by the Vercel CLI, telemetry pulls, ad-hoc debugging,
# and one-off scratch dumps. They must NEVER be committed; ignoring
# them at the source-control boundary closes the "surprise diagnostic
# in the working tree" failure mode that prior batches hit.
#
# If you genuinely need to commit one of these (e.g., a permanent
# diagnostic report), name it explicitly and add it to /scripts or
# /docs — do NOT use one of these patterns.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.telem-pull*
.vercel-*
*.tmp
debug-*
scratch-*
report-*
out.txt
dump-*

# Trestle/Cotality diagnostic dumps + local config backups.
# Security: these may contain OAuth tokens / credentials — never commit.
.trestle_*
*.cleanbak
vercel-*-backup.txt

# Smoke runner reports (timestamped per run, never committed)
ops/audit/sales-smoke/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated junk + obsolete root artifacts (PR chore/remove-generated-junk 2026-06-03)
#
# Compiled Python caches (the backend/ stub is not a build target here).
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Root-anchored dev screenshots. Leading "/" keeps this scoped to the
# repo root ONLY — it does NOT match app/icon.png, app/apple-icon.png,
# or public/images/*.png, which are real shipped assets.
/*.png

# Orphaned root dumps removed in this PR (0 code refs). Root-anchored so
# similarly-named files inside subdirectories are unaffected.
/value
/trestle-fields.json
/repo-fields.json
/audit-trestle-report.json
/old-list.txt
/SALE_SEARCH_SPEC.json
/RENTAL_SEARCH_SPEC.json
/baseline-note-from-session.txt
/SALE-FORM-FIELDS-COMPLETE.txt
/SALE-FORM-FIELDS-EXTRACTED.txt
# NOTE: rotation-history.log is intentionally force-committed by
# .github/workflows/rotate-db-keys.yml (git add -f) as a rotation audit
# trail and is allow-listed in scripts/ci/repo-hygiene.mjs — do NOT ignore it.

# Local/operator scratch files
scripts/__*
!scripts/__tests__/
!scripts/__tests__/**
__pw-*/
__pw-review*/
.playwright-mcp/
.superpowers/

# Local ops/debug outputs
/ops-health-*.json
/branch-cleanup-*.txt
/pr*-*.jpeg

# Generated audit / smoke run-output (regenerated per run; never committed)
/ops/audit/

# Local backup/scratch dirs
/backups/

# Gate 3 terminal_since backfill touched-id logs (operational rollback artifacts, not repo history)
artifacts/gate3-backfill-touched-*.jsonl
# Gate 6 archive-drain touched-id logs (operational audit artifacts, not repo history)
artifacts/gate6-archive-touched-*.jsonl

# Playwright run artifacts (traces, screenshots, error contexts)
test-results/
playwright-report/
tests/e2e/_artifacts/

# Cotality diagnostic output — ephemeral evidence, regenerated on demand.
# Never a runtime input and never field authority.
artifacts/cotality-drift/
artifacts/cotality-snapshots/

# Raw provider wire captures are ephemeral diagnostic evidence, never tracked
# and never authority. The verified contract is data/cotality-contract.live.json.
artifacts/metadata.xml
